# netsurf: paint box-shadow lists (outer and inset, with spread)
#
# Companion to 96-libcss-box-shadow-full-list.patch. html_redraw_box
# paints css_computed_box_shadow_full():
#   - outer shadows before the background, as the shadow rect minus the
#     border box (up to four rects), with the clip widened to the
#     parent's;
#   - inset shadows after the background and before the borders, as the
#     padding box minus the offset, spread-shrunk hole.
# Colours carry their alpha (and the element's opacity) in the plot
# style's opacity, so the plotters blend them like rgba backgrounds.
# Blur is approximated: +blur/2 of spread, alpha x 2/(2+blur). Border
# radius is ignored. A style with the list skips MacSurf's packed
# single-shadow path, and box_ink_outset sizes outer shadows from the list.
